{"resource": {"name": "BIS - Median processing time for new regime regulations (months)", "id": "ezjk-h2nx", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Changes to regime control lists have been agreed to by the members of the multilateral regimes, who are the U.S. export control partners. If those changes result in tighter controls, they must be implemented to address national security or proliferation concerns, and if they result in liberalizations, they must be implemented to ensure that U.S. industry is not disadvantaged vis-\u00e0-vis our allies. Therefore, it is important to refer the draft multilateral changes for interagency review in three months or less from plenary meeting dates in order to meet our multilateral obligations, maximize U.S. competitiveness, and enable economic growth for American industries, workers, and consumers. Effective and efficient adaptation of export controls advances responsible economic growth and trade while protecting American security.", "attribution": "Bureau of Industry and Security", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-07-19T20:53:50.000Z", "createdAt": "2019-03-18T15:50:09.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-19T20:53:50.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2021-11-26T20:02:26.000Z", "columns_name": ["Indicator", "Actual", "Status", "Target", "Proximity", "Fiscal Year"], "columns_field_name": ["indicator", "actual", "status", "target", "proximity", "fiscal_year"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Calendar date"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {"precisionStyle": "percentage", "percentScale": "1"}, {"view": "date"}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2021-11-26T20:01:15.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": ["economy"], "tags": [], "domain_category": "KPI: BIS", "domain_tags": ["administration of justice", "commerce & trade", "economic development", "economic security & policy", "international affairs", "national security"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Affirmation_I-affirm-that,-to-the-best-of-my-knowledge,-this-data-is-accurate-and-does-not-contain-any-personally-identifiable-information-(PII)-or-business-identifiable-information-(BII)", "value": "Yes"}, {"key": "Program-Activity_Program-Activity-Name", "value": "Export Administration"}, {"key": "Strategic-Objective-2022-2026_Strategic-Objective-Name", "value": "1.4 - Protect national security interests and enforce trade rules"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "performance.commerce.gov", "license": "Public Domain U.S. Government"}, "permalink": "https://performance.commerce.gov/d/ezjk-h2nx", "link": "https://performance.commerce.gov/KPI-BIS/BIS-Median-processing-time-for-new-regime-regulati/ezjk-h2nx", "owner": {"id": "ecyf-a7ia", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "kmemmott-kern"}, "creator": {"id": "ecyf-a7ia", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "kmemmott-kern"}}
{"resource": {"name": "BIS - Percent of attendees rating seminars highly.", "id": "tcnh-4k2t", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This metric is designed to measure the overall effectiveness of the entire export control outreach seminar program. Given the volume of trade from the United States, informing U.S. and foreign businesses of the requirements of the EAR is a critical component of our export control system. The target is for at least 93% of the seminar attendees to give the seminar an overall rating of at least 4 (out of a 5 level scale).", "attribution": "Bureau of Industry and Security", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-07-19T20:53:53.000Z", "createdAt": "2019-03-18T17:42:11.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-19T20:53:53.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2021-11-10T15:47:34.000Z", "columns_name": ["Fiscal Year", "Indicator", "Target", "Proximity", "Status", "Actual"], "columns_field_name": ["fiscal_year", "indicator", "target", "proximity", "status", "actual"], "columns_datatype": ["Calendar date", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{"view": "date"}, {}, {"precisionStyle": "percentage", "percentScale": "1", "precision": "0"}, {"precisionStyle": "percentage", "percentScale": "1"}, {}, {"precisionStyle": "percentage", "percentScale": "1", "precision": "0"}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2021-11-09T21:24:07.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": ["social services"], "tags": [], "domain_category": "KPI: BIS", "domain_tags": ["administration of justice", "commerce & trade", "economic development", "economic security & policy", "international affairs", "national security"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Affirmation_I-affirm-that,-to-the-best-of-my-knowledge,-this-data-is-accurate-and-does-not-contain-any-